<p class="mb-3 whitespace-pre-wrap break-words leading-6 last:mb-0 leading-prose">Learn more in TypeSafe&#x27;s docs: <a href="https://docs.typesafe.ai/concepts/system-one" class="underline underline-offset-2 decoration-current/40 hover:text-accent-foreground hover:decoration-current transition-colors" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-describedby="_R_5lkebsnqbt3bml9ivb_">https://docs.typesafe.ai/concepts/system-one<span id="_R_5lkebsnqbt3bml9ivb_" hidden="">Opens in new tab</span></a></p></div></div></div><div class="mt-7 grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-5"><div class="w-full min-w-0 rounded-lg border border-border bg-card px-3 py-2.5"><p class="text-2xs font-medium text-muted-foreground uppercase tracking-wide">Modalities</p><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mt-2.5"><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md size-5 bg-modality-text/12" id="base-ui-_R_eomebsnqbt3bml9ivb_"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-type size-3 text-modality-text" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 4v16"></path><path d="M4 7V5a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h14a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v2"></path><path d="M9 20h6"></path></svg></span></div><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-3 w-3 shrink-0 text-faint" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg><div class="flex items-center gap-1"><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md size-5 bg-modality-rerank/12" id="base-ui-_R_fomebsnqbt3bml9ivb_"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-lineca