e class="h-full w-full shrink-0"><img width="256" height="256" alt="Favicon for https://github.com/patent-process-mining" class="h-full w-full object-cover" src="https://t0.gstatic.com/faviconV2?client=SOCIAL&amp;type=FAVICON&amp;fallback_opts=TYPE,SIZE,URL&amp;url=https://github.com/patent-process-mining&amp;size=256" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></picture></div></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 rounded-[inherit] ring-1 ring-inset ring-border/60 dark:inset-px dark:ring-white"></div></div><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col"><a class="text-foreground underline underline-offset-2 decoration-current/40 hover:text-accent-foreground hover:decoration-current transition-colors cursor-pointer group text-xs block truncate font-medium" href="/apps/url/https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fpatent-process-mining">onet-crosswalk pilot-01<!-- --> <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="inline w-4 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-0.5"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.28 11.47a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.06l-7.5 7.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.06-1.06L14.69 12 7.72 5.03a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06l7.5 7.5Z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></a><div class="text-muted-foreground flex items-center gap-1 text-xs"><span class="text-faint">new</span></div></div></div><div class="col-span-4 flex items-center justify-end gap-3 text-right text-muted-foreground text-xs"><div><span>10.2B</span><span class="ml-1">tokens</span></div></div></div></div><div class="lg:w-1/2"><div class="recharts-responsive-container relative z-10 w-full [&amp;_svg]:outline-hidden" style="width:100%;height:320px;min-width:0"><div style="width:0;overflow-x:visible"></div></div></div></div></div></div><script>$RC("B:6","S:6")</script><div hidden id="S:7"><section id="faq" class="scroll-mt-[calc(185px+var(--sticky-banner-top,0px))] lg:scroll-mt-[calc(126px+var(--sticky-banner-top,0px))] mb-10 last:mb-0"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4 gap-y-2 mb-3"><div class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-question-mark h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg><h2 class="text-base font-medium">Frequently asked questions</h2></div></div><div class="rounded-lg border border-border border-none p-0"><div class="overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-border bg-card text-card-foreground px-4" data-orientation="vertical" dir="ltr" role="region"><div data-orientation="vertical" data-index="-1" data-closed="" class="border-b border-border last:border-0"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-index="-1" data-closed="" class="flex"><button type="button" data-value="" data-orientation="vertical" data-index="-1" aria-disabled="false" aria-expanded="false" id="base-ui-_R_taepbqubsnqbt3bml9ivbH2_" tabindex="0" class="flex flex-1 cursor-pointer items-center justify-between font-medium transition-colors duration-fast ease-smooth-out focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:border-focus-border focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-panel-open]&gt;svg.accordion-chevron]:rotate-180 gap-4 py-4 text-left text-base hover:text-foreground">What is Jev 1.13?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down accordion-chevron size-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-fast ease-smooth-out motion-reduce:transition-none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-orientation="vertical" data-index="-1" data-closed="" hidden="" id="base-ui-_R_taepbqubsnqbt3bml9ivbH1_" aria-labelledby="base-ui-_R_taepbqubsnqbt3bml9ivbH2_" role="region" style="--accordion-panel-height:auto;--accordion-panel-width:auto" data-testid="faq-panel" class="h-(--accordion-panel-height) overflow-hidden transition-[height,opacity] duration-slow ease-smooth-out data-[starting-style]:h-0 data-[starting-style]:opacity-0 data-[ending-style]:h-0 data-[ending-style]:opacity-0 data-[ending-style]:duration-medium motion-reduce:transition-opacity motion-reduce:duration-quick motion-reduce:data-[ending-style]:duration-quick motion-reduce:data-[starting-style]:h-auto motion-reduce:data-[ending-style]:h-auto text-body leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground [&amp;&gt;div]:pb-4"><div class="pb-3 pt-0"><p class="mb-3 whitespace-pre-wrap break-words leading-6 last:mb-0">Jev is a structured decision model from TypeSafe, and the first of its System One models. System One models make fast, structured decisions for software, returning a typed choice rather than free-form text. It is suited for routing, classification, and other decision points inside an application where a fast, predictable answer matters more than generated prose.</p></div></div></div><div data-orientation="vertical" data-index="-1" data-closed="" class="border-b border-border last:border-0"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-index="-1" data-closed="" class="flex"><button type="button" data-value="" data-orientation="vertical" data-index="-1" aria-disabled="false" aria-expanded="false" id="base-ui-_R_1daepbqubsnqbt3bml9ivbH2_" tabindex="0" class="flex flex-1 cursor-pointer items-center justify-between font-medium transition-colors duration-fast ease-smooth-out focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:border-focus-border focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-panel-open]&gt;svg.accordion-chevron]:rotate-180 gap-4 py-4 text-left text-base hover:text-foreground">Where is the Jev 1.13 documentation?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down accordion-chevron size-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-fast ease-smooth-out motion-reduce:transition-none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-orientation="vertical" data-index="-1" data-closed="" hidden="" id="base-ui-_R_1daepbqubsnqbt3bml9ivbH1_" aria-labelledby="base-ui-_R_1daepbqubsnqbt3bml9ivbH2_" role="region" style="--accordion-panel-height:auto;--accordion-panel-width:auto" data-testid="faq-panel" class="h-(--accordion-panel-height) overflow-hidden transition-[height,opacity] duration-slow ease-smooth-out data-[starting-style]:h-0 data-[starting-style]:opacity-0 data-[ending-style]:h-0 data-[ending-style]:opacity-0 data-[ending-style]:duration-medium motion-reduce:transition-opacity motion-reduce:duration-quick motion-reduce:data-[ending-style]:duration-quick motion-reduce:data-[starting-style]:h-auto motion-reduce:data-[ending-style]:h-auto text-body leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground [&amp;&gt;div]:pb-4"><div class="pb-3 pt-0"><p class="mb-3 whitespace-pre-wrap break-words leading-6 last:mb-0">The Jev 1.13 documentation on OpenRouter includes the <a href="/docs/guides/community/jev-tutorial" class="underline underline-offset-2 decoration-current/40 hover:text-accent-foreground hover:decoration-current transition-colors">Jev Tutorial</a> guide, the <a href="/docs/guides/community/jev" class="underline underline-offset-2 decoration-current/40 hover:text-accent-foreground hover:decoration-current transition-colors">Jev (TypeSafe)</a> guide, the <a href="/docs/guides/community/typesafe-sdk" class="underline underline-offset-2 decoration-current/40 hover:text-accent-foreground hover:decoration-current transition-colors">TypeSafe SDK (Jev)</a> guide, the <a href="/docs/cookbook/building-agents/gate-tool-calls-with-jev" class="underline underline-offset-2 decoration-current/40 hover:text-accent-foreground hover:decoration-current transition-colors">Gate Agent Tool Calls with Jev</a> cookbook, the <a href="/docs/cookbook/coding-agents/auto-approve-permission-prompts-with-jev" class="underline underline-offset-2 decoration-current/40 hover:text-accent-foreground hover:decoration-current transition-colors">Auto-Approve Coding Agent Permission Prompts with Jev</a> cookbook, the <a href="/docs/cookbook/evaluate-and-optimize/classify-reddit-comments-with-jev" class="underline underline-offset-2 decoration-current/40 hover:text-accent-foreground hover:decoration-current transition-colors">Classify Reddit and YouTube Comments with Jev and ScrapeCreators</a> cookbook, the <a href="/docs/cookbook/evaluate-and-optimize/jev-classification" class="underline underline-offset-2 decoration-current/40 hover:text-accent-foreground hover:decoration-current transition-colors">Classify and Tag Text at Scale with Jev</a> cookbook, the <a href="/docs/cookbook/evaluate-and-optimize/jev-verified-cascade" class="underline underline-offset-2 decoration-current/40 hover:text-accent-foreground hover:decoration-current transition-colors">Cut LLM Cost with a Jev-Verified Cascade</a> cookbook, and the interactive <a href="/labs/jev" class="underline underline-offset-2 decoration-current/40 hover:text-accent-foreground hover:decoration-current transition-colors">Jev Lab</a>. The <a href="/docs/quickstart" class="underline underline-offset-2 decoration-current/40 hover:text-accent-foreground hover:decoration-current transition-colors">quickstart</a> covers API keys and your first request, and the <a href="/docs/api-reference/overview" class="underline underline-offset-2 decoration-current/40 hover:text-accent-foreground hover:decoration-current transition-colors">API reference</a> lists every parameter.</p></div></div></div><div data-orientation="vertical" data-index="-1" data-closed="" class="border-b border-border last:border-0"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-index="-1" data-closed="" class="flex"><button type="button" data-value="" data-orientation="vertical" data-index="-1" aria-disabled="false" aria-expanded="false" id="base-ui-_R_1taepbqubsnqbt3bml9ivbH2_" tabindex="0" class="flex flex-1 cursor-pointer items-center justify-between font-medium transition-colors duration-fast ease-smooth-out focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:border-focus-border focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-panel-open]&gt;svg.accordion-chevron]:rotate-180 gap-4 py-4 text-left text-base hover:text-foreground">How much does Jev 1.13 cost?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down accordion-chevron size-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-fast ease-smooth-out motion-reduce:transition-none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-orientation="vertical" data-index="-1" data-closed="" hidden="" id="base-ui-_R_1taepbqubsnqbt3bml9ivbH1_" aria-labelledby="base-ui-_R_1taepbqubsnqbt3bml9ivbH2_" role="region" style="--accordion-panel-height:auto;--accordion-panel-width:auto" data-testid="faq-panel" class="h-(--accordion-panel-height) overflow-hidden transition-[height,opacity] duration-slow ease-smooth-out data-[starting-style]:h-0 data-[starting-style]:opacity-0 data-[ending-style]:h-0 data-[ending-style]:opacity-0 data-[ending-style]:duration-medium motion-reduce:transition-opacity motion-reduce:duration-quick motion-reduce:data-[ending-style]:duration-quick motion-reduce:data-[starting-style]:h-auto motion-reduce:data-[ending-style]:h-auto text-body leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground [&amp;&gt;div]:pb-4"><div class="pb-3 pt-0"><p class="mb-3 whitespace-pre-wrap break-words leading-6 last:mb-0">Jev 1.13 costs $0.042/M input tokens and $0.00/M output tokens.</p></div></div></div><div data-orientation="vertical" data-index="-1" data-closed="" class="border-b border-border last:border-0"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-index="-1" data-closed="" class="flex"><button type="button" data-value="" data-orientation="vertical" data-index="-1" aria-disabled="false" aria-expanded="false" id="base-ui-_R_2daepbqubsnqbt3bml9ivbH2_" tabindex="0" class="flex flex-1 cursor-pointer items-center justify-between font-medium transition-colors duration-fast ease-smooth-out focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:border-focus-border focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-panel-open]&gt;svg.accordion-chevron]:rotate-180 gap-4 py-4 text-left text-base hover:text-foreground">What is the context length of Jev 1.13?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down accordion-chevron size-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-fast ease-smooth-out motion-reduce:transition-none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-orientation="vertical" data-index="-1" data-closed="" hidden="" id="base-ui-_R_2daepbqubsnqbt3bml9ivbH1_" aria-labelledby="base-ui-_R_2daepbqubsnqbt3bml9ivbH2_" role="region" style="--accordion-panel-height:auto;--accordion-panel-width:auto" data-testid="faq-panel" class="h-(--accordion-panel-height) overflow-hidden transition-[height,opacity] duration-slow ease-smooth-out data-[starting-style]:h-0 data-[starting-style]:opacity-0 data-[ending-style]:h-0 data-[ending-style]:opacity-0 data-[ending-style]:duration-medium motion-reduce:transition-opacity motion-reduce:duration-quick motion-reduce:data-[ending-style]:duration-quick motion-reduce:data-[starting-style]:h-auto motion-reduce:data-[ending-style]:h-auto text-body leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground [&amp;&gt;div]:pb-4"><div class="pb-3 pt-0"><p class="mb-3 whitespace-pre-wrap break-words leading-6 last:mb-0">Jev 1.13 has a 32,000 token context window.</p></div></div></div><div data-orientation="vertical" data-index="-1" data-closed="" class="border-b border-border last:border-0"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-index="-1" data-closed="" class="flex"><button type="button" data-value="" data-orientation="vertical" data-index="-1" aria-disabled="false" aria-expanded="false" id="base-ui-_R_2taepbqubsnqbt3bml9ivbH2_" tabindex="0" class="flex flex-1 cursor-pointer items-center justify-between font-medium transition-colors duration-fast ease-smooth-out focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:border-focus-border focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-panel-open]&gt;svg.accordion-chevron]:rotate-180 gap-4 py-4 text-left text-base hover:text-foreground">What inputs and outputs does Jev 1.13 support?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down accordion-chevron size-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-fast ease-smooth-out motion-reduce:transition-none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-orientation="vertical" data-index="-1" data-closed="" hidden="" id="base-ui-_R_2taepbqubsnqbt3bml9ivbH1_" aria-labelledby="base-ui-_R_2taepbqubsnqbt3bml9ivbH2_" role="region" style="--accordion-panel-height:auto;--accordion-panel-width:auto" data-testid="faq-panel" class="h-(--accordion-panel-height) overflow-hidden transition-[height,opacity] duration-slow ease-smooth-out data-[starting-style]:h-0 data-[starting-style]:opacity-0 data-[ending-style]:h-0 data-[ending-style]:opacity-0 data-[ending-style]:duration-medium motion-reduce:transition-opacity motion-reduce:duration-quick motion-reduce:data-[ending-style]:duration-quick motion-reduce:data-[starting-style]:h-auto motion-reduce:data-[ending-style]:h-auto text-body leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground [&amp;&gt;div]:pb-4"><div class="pb-3 pt-0"><p class="mb-3 whitespace-pre-wrap break-words leading-6 last:mb-0">Jev 1.13 accepts text as input and returns structured decisions.</p></div></div></div><div data-orientation="vertical" data-index="-1" data-closed="" class="border-b border-border last:border-0"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-index="-1" data-closed="" class="flex"><button type="button" data-value="" data-orientation="vertical" data-index="-1" aria-disabled="false" aria-expanded="false" id="base-ui-_R_3daepbqubsnqbt3bml9ivbH2_" tabindex="0" class="flex flex-1 cursor-pointer items-center justify-between font-medium transition-colors duration-fast ease-smooth-out focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:border-focus-border focus-visible:shadow-focus [&amp;[data-panel-open]&gt;svg.accordion-chevron]:rotate-180 gap-4 py-4 text-left text-base hover:text-foreground">When was Jev 1.13 released?<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down accordion-chevron size-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform duration-fast ease-smooth-out motion-reduce:transition-none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-orientation="vertical" data-index="-1" data-closed="" hidden="" id="base-ui-_R_3daepbqubsnqbt3bml9ivbH1_" aria-labelledby="base-ui-_R_3daepbqubsnqbt3bml9ivbH2_" role="region" style="--accordion-panel-height:auto;--accordion-panel-width:auto" data-testid="faq-panel" class="h-(--accordion-panel-height) overflow-hidden transition-[height,opacity] duration-slow ease-smooth-out data-[starting-style]:h-0 data-[starting-style]:opacity-0 data-[ending-style]:h-0 data-[ending-style]:opacity-0 data-[ending-style]:duration-medium motion-reduce:transition-opacity motion-reduce:duration-quick motion-reduce:data-[ending-style]:duration-quick motion-reduce:data-[starting-style]:h-auto motion-reduce:data-[ending-style]:h-auto text-body leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground [&amp;&gt;div]:pb-4"><div class="pb-3 pt-0"><p class="mb-3 whitespace-pre-wrap break-words leading-6 last:mb-0">Jev 1.13 was released on September 18, 2026.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is Jev 1.13?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Jev is a structured decision model from TypeSafe, and the first of its System One models. System One models make fast, structured decisions for software, returning a typed choice rather than free-form text. It is suited for routing, classification, and other decision points inside an application where a fast, predictable answer matters more than generated prose."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Where is the Jev 1.13 documentation?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The Jev 1.13 documentation on OpenRouter includes the Jev Tutorial guide, the Jev (TypeSafe) guide, the TypeSafe SDK (Jev) guide, the Gate Agent Tool Calls with Jev cookbook, the Auto-Approve Coding Agent Permission Prompts with Jev cookbook, the Classify Reddit and YouTube Comments with Jev and ScrapeCreators cookbook, the Classify and Tag Text at Scale with Jev cookbook, the Cut LLM Cost with a Jev-Verified Cascade cookbook, and the interactive Jev Lab. The quickstart covers API keys and your first request, and the API reference lists every parameter."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How much does Jev 1.13 cost?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Jev 1.13 costs $0.042/M input tokens and $0.00/M output tokens."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the context length of Jev 1.13?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Jev 1.13 has a 32,000 token context window."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What inputs and outputs does Jev 1.13 support?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Jev 1.13 accepts text as input and returns structured decisions."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"When was Jev 1.13 released?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Jev 1.13 was released on September 18, 2026."}}]}</script></div><script>$RC("B:7","S:7")</script><div hidden id="S:8"><div class="my-8 w-full first:mt-0"><div class="min-w-0 w-full"><h2>More models from<!-- --> <span class=""><a class="text-inherit underline" href="/typesafe">Typesafe</a></span></h2><div class="mt-4"><div class="overflow-hidden"><section class="group/carousel hover:cursor-move relative w-full" aria-roledescription="carousel"><div><div class="flex -ml-4"><div role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 grow-0 pl-4 basis-auto"><a class="group flex h-full w-64 shrink-0 flex-col justify-between gap-y-2 rounded-lg border px-4 py-3 text-left md:w-80" href="/typesafe/jev-router"><div class="line-clamp-1 text-heading font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-accent-foreground group-hover:underline">Jev Router</div><div class="line-clamp-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground"><p class="mb-3 whitespace-pre-wrap break-words leading-6 last:mb-0">Jev Router picks the best model and reasoning effort for each request, balancing quality, speed, and cost. It runs on <span>Jev</span>, TypeSafe&#x27;s first System One model, and adapts as your conversation evolves. One endpoint gives you the whole model ecosystem, leveraging the ecosystem&#x27;s token and spend share.</p></div><div aria-label="Model details" class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1 text-overline text-muted-foreground tabular-nums"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><span>Text</span></span><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block size-[0.215em] shrink-0 rounded-full bg-current align-middle"></span><span>1M context</span></span></div></a></div><div role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" class="min-w-0 shrink-0 grow-0 pl-4 basis-auto"><a class="group flex h-full w-64 shrink-0 flex-col justify-between gap-y-2 rounded-lg border px-4 py-3 text-left md:w-80" href="/~typesafe/jev-latest"><div class="line-clamp-1 text-heading font-semibold text-foreground group-hover:text-accent-foreground group-hover:underline">Jev Latest</div><div class="line-clamp-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground"><p class="mb-3 whitespace-pre-wrap break-words leading-6 last:mb-0">This model always redirects to the latest model in the Jev family.</p></div><div aria-label="Model details" class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 gap-y-1 text-overline text-muted-foreground tabular-nums"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2"><span>Decisions</span></span></div></a></div></div></div><button type="button" class="justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-button font-medium cursor-pointer no-underline focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:border-focus-border focus-visible:shadow-focus disabled:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 hover:bg-accent-subtle hover:text-accent-foreground active:bg-accent-subtle/80 absolute size-8 opacity-0 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 transition-opacity -left-6 z-10 hidden h-full w-16 items-center rounded-lg md:flex via-background to-background from-transparent hover:bg-gradient-to-l bg-inherit group-hover/carousel:opacity-0 hover:!opacity-100 disabled:opacity-0" data-disabled="" disabled=""><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" data-slot="icon" class="size-4"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M10.5 19.5 3 12m0 0 7.5-7.5M3 12h18"></path></svg><span class="sr-only">Previous slide</span></button><button type="button" class="justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-button font-medium cursor-pointer no-underline focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:border-focus-border focus-visible:shadow-focus disabled:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:point